    name: Foundation alone, 2024 (Form 990)
    summary: 'The Foundation without its subsidiaries: revenue $37.2 million against expenses of $41.2 million; $23.0 million of program service revenue is trademark licence fees paid by the operating companies, $6.5 million is contributions and grants.'
